 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Two paths for «مذبذبين», nothing for the Fire (145, night sky), then light for «تابوا», hands for «واعتصموا بالله», geometric for «شاكرا عليما». 145:8-11 «ولن تجد لهم نصيرا» is not glossed (the only excerpt would read as a helper). 144:16-17 «سلطانا» not glossed (the tafsirs word the proof differently). STAGING v4: 143-144: a town at dusk; believers on one side, disbelievers on the other, a small group of men (3, the hypocrites) in the middle turns away and back (143:1, 143:3: wavering); the camera moves to one side and the other on 143:6 and 143:9; nothing is acted on the negations 143:4-9 or on the prohibition 144:4-10 (the believers only stand together). 145 stays ambient: the lowest depth of the Fire (the unseen). 146: in a prayer hall the same small group lowers their heads on 146:3 (repenting), raises their hands on 146:5 (holding fast to Allah, As-Sa'di: taking refuge in Him), walks to the believers on 146:11 (they are with the believers) and sits with them on 146:14; nothing is acted on the conditional 147:5-7. The cover moves to 143 (the hypocrites between the two groups) so that it matches its title."
 },
